     "<p style=\"font-size:16px;color:rgb(31,31,31);font-family:&quot;Google Sans&quot;,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,sans-serif;margin:0px 0px 24px;word-break:break-word\"><span style=\"border:0px;font-style:inherit;font-variant:inherit;font-weight:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;font-size:10pt;line-height:inherit;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,Times,serif;font-kerning:inherit;font-feature-settings:inherit;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline\">I hope this email finds you well.</span><span style=\"border:0px;font-style:inherit;font-variant:inherit;font-weight:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;font-size:10pt;line-height:inherit;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,Times,serif;font-kerning:inherit;font-feature-settings:inherit;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline\"> I am a graduate student at Missouri State University,</span><span style=\"border:0px;font-style:inherit;font-variant:inherit;font-weight:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;font-size:10pt;line-height:inherit;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,Times,serif;font-kerning:inherit;font-feature-settings:inherit;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline\"> currently conducting research on the survival and detection probability of the Egyptian Tortoise,</span><span style=\"border:0px;font-style:inherit;font-variant:inherit;font-weight:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;font-size:10pt;line-height:inherit;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,Times,serif;font-kerning:inherit;font-feature-settings:inherit;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline\"> a critically endangered species in the Mediterranean basin.</span><span style=\"border:0px;font-style:inherit;font-variant:inherit;font-weight:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;font-size:10pt;line-height:inherit;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,Times,serif;font-kerning:inherit;font-feature-settings:inherit;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline\"> I have meticulously gathered data from five different sites over the past two decades.</span></p><p style=\"font-size:16px;color:rgb(31,31,31);font-family:&quot;Google Sans&quot;,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,sans-serif;margin:24px 0px;word-break:break-word\"><span style=\"border:0px;font-style:inherit;font-variant:inherit;font-weight:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;font-size:10pt;line-height:inherit;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,Times,serif;font-kerning:inherit;font-feature-settings:inherit;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline\">I am writing to request an assistance in performing a multistate analysis,</span><span style=\"border:0px;font-style:inherit;font-variant:inherit;font-weight:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;font-size:10pt;line-height:inherit;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,Times,serif;font-kerning:inherit;font-feature-settings:inherit;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline\"> particularly in transitioning from less than one year to juvenile,</span><span style=\"border:0px;font-style:inherit;font-variant:inherit;font-weight:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;font-size:10pt;line-height:inherit;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,Times,serif;font-kerning:inherit;font-feature-settings:inherit;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline\"> and from juvenile to male or female states.</span></p><p style=\"font-size:16px;color:rgb(31,31,31);font-family:&quot;Google Sans&quot;,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,sans-serif;margin:24px 0px;word-break:break-word\"><span style=\"border:0px;font-style:inherit;font-variant:inherit;font-weight:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;font-size:10pt;line-height:inherit;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,Times,serif;font-kerning:inherit;font-feature-settings:inherit;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline\">I am currently based in Egypt,</span><span style=\"border:0px;font-style:inherit;font-variant:inherit;font-weight:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;font-size:10pt;line-height:inherit;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,Times,serif;font-kerning:inherit;font-feature-settings:inherit;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline\"> where I serve as an ecologist in the Zaranik protected area.</span><span style=\"border:0px;font-style:inherit;font-variant:inherit;font-weight:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;font-size:10pt;line-height:inherit;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,Times,serif;font-kerning:inherit;font-feature-settings:inherit;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline\"> I have the necessary codes and JAGS models,</span><span style=\"border:0px;font-style:inherit;font-variant:inherit;font-weight:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;font-size:10pt;line-height:inherit;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,Times,serif;font-kerning:inherit;font-feature-settings:inherit;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline\"> but I have encountered some errors in running the R code.</span><span style=\"border:0px;font-style:inherit;font-variant:inherit;font-weight:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;font-size:10pt;line-height:inherit;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,Times,serif;font-kerning:inherit;font-feature-settings:inherit;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline\"> I have also not yet developed the R code for the new transition from less than one year to juvenile and from Juvenile to male or female.</span><span style=\"border:0px;font-style:inherit;font-variant:inherit;font-weight:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;font-size:10pt;line-height:inherit;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,Times,serif;font-kerning:inherit;font-feature-settings:inherit;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline\"> Your assistance would be invaluable,</span><span style=\"border:0px;font-style:inherit;font-variant:inherit;font-weight:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;font-size:10pt;line-height:inherit;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,Times,serif;font-kerning:inherit;font-feature-settings:inherit;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline\"> as my advisor needs this analysis and I have been stuck on this step for over a month developing the R code.</span><br aria-hidden=\"true\"></p><p style=\"font-size:16px;color:rgb(31,31,31);font-family:&quot;Google Sans&quot;,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,sans-serif;margin:24px 0px;word-break:break-word\"><span style=\"border:0px;font-style:inherit;font-variant:inherit;font-weight:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;font-size:10pt;line-height:inherit;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,Times,serif;font-kerning:inherit;font-feature-settings:inherit;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:inherit\">Thank you for your time and consideration.</span><span style=\"border:0px;font-style:inherit;font-variant:inherit;font-weight:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;font-size:10pt;line-height:inherit;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,Times,serif;font-kerning:inherit;font-feature-settings:inherit;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:inherit\"> I look forward to hearing from you soon.</span></p><p style=\"font-size:16px;color:rgb(31,31,31);font-family:&quot;Google Sans&quot;,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,sans-serif;margin:24px 0px;word-break:break-word\"><span style=\"border:0px;font-style:inherit;font-variant:inherit;font-weight:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;font-size:10pt;line-height:inherit;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,Times,serif;font-kerning:inherit;font-feature-settings:inherit;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:inherit\">Sincerely,</span></p><p style=\"font-size:16px;color:rgb(31,31,31);font-family:&quot;Google Sans&quot;,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,sans-serif;margin:24px 0px;word-break:break-word\"><span style=\"border:0px;font-style:inherit;font-variant:inherit;font-weight:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;font-size:10pt;line-height:inherit;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,Times,serif;font-kerning:inherit;font-feature-settings:inherit;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:inherit\">Basem Motwaly</span></p>"
